Package: kassiber
Version: @@VERSION@@
Architecture: @@ARCH@@
Maintainer: Bitcoin Austria <office@bitcoin-austria.at>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/bitcoinaustria/kassiber
Installed-Size: @@INSTALLED_KB@@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers | vulkan-icd, fontconfig
